This product includes a copy of fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The header is resolved at build time from the release
pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of it.

The 292-byte wire format, the field order, the per-domain flags and the
expression mapping were informed by the VRCFT module CympleFaceTracking
(https://github.com/Dominocs/CympleFaceTracking, GPL-3.0) and cross-checked
against the independent OpenCymple decoder
(https://github.com/K1TTYBLACK/OpenCymple). This repository is an independent
C++ implementation of that wire format and contains none of their source code.

